WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.060
Hey.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:08.820
Riko.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:13.120
I was thinking all last night about the 
romantic advice we should give.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.700
Oh, that.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.920
Shoot right through his heart.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.000
Don't you think it's a great way 
to get a boy interested?

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.630
This is not where your 
brainpower should be going!

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.720
You're so mean!

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.970
I made that mechanism myself.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.120
This isn't the time for that!

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.310
We've got four requests from students,

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.640
no way to reply to them,

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.310
and a pair of weird girls investigating us.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.950
I know.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:53.240
I am taking this situation very seriously.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:57.060
After much consideration, 
I arrived at a conclusion!

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:01.070
We should conduct as many 
love labs as we possibly can!

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.500
Why?!

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:38.500
<b>To the Kurahashi House!</b>

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.350
This is like one of those 
heartwarming news stories.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.980
I'm not a cat stuck in a tree!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.230
And to prove it...

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.540
I'm scared!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.800
You're such a mean girl! 
You're a demon! A demon!

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.690
You're blaming me?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:57.690
I'm so scared!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.240
Want me to help you?

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.910
I-I will not accept help from an old enemy!

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.660
"Old enemy"? We've never met.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.100
You don't remember?!

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.040
Sayo, what are you doing?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.240
You're the root of all evil!

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:11.840
What's your problem?

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.170
I'll make you cry "uncle" someday!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.250
Uncle.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.920
I did it!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.900
Here's a freebie for you.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.740
Uncle, uncle, uncle...

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.740
Have some from me, too.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.130
Uncle, uncle, uncle...

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.510
They're harmonizing! Yeah!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.660
Nana-chan, calm down.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.180
Momo-senpai.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.840
Are you okay?

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.770
I was wondering where you went.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.360
Kurahashi-san just threw 
something out of the window.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.970
President Maki seemed panicked,
 so thought I'd go pick it up.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:43.240
I tried taking a shortcut over the wall, 
but it was taller than I thought...

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.890
I lost what could've been my chance at a scoop!

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.980
Nana-chan, you're so loud.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.000
Sorry, Sayo-chan.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:00.510
You know her?

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.000
This might really be a problem.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.290
Please knock!!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:07.300
I see.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.270
Maybe we really should 
go easy on the love labs.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.020
What?

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:17.100
An underhanded person like Mizushima-senpai, 
who thinks nothing of eavesdropping

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:21.240
and breaking and entering, 
says it's a problem.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:25.160
You know, Kurahashi, I'm 
pretty scary when I'm angry.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.530
Uh... I'm kidding, I'm kidding!

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:31.800
Well, I don't think there's 
anyone at Fuji Girls' who can

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.000
commit any mischief without me noticing.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.670
I wouldn't expect any less.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.980
Amazing. I must learn from her.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.710
I don't think you need to learn that.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.390
Momo is different from me.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:45.620
Are you saying she'll attack us directly?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:50.720
She'll probably come at us with a curve 
ball that just barely qualifies as direct.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.160
Funny...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.560
That doesn't seem different.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.430
You seem to know an awful lot 
about her. Were you friends?

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:58.160
I don't know her.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.640
No, not really.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:03.010
We were in the same group 
during elementary school, once.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.530
Hmm...

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.640
So, it seems we have no choice but 
to wait and see what she will do.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:13.510
Can't we continue conducting love 
labs with tighter security until then?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.400
Yeah, but...

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.250
I'm worried.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.380
Who cares?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.680
Let's do it!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.130
I don't like this!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.110
I support your love labs!

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.840
Thank you.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.760
You're unusually assertive.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:33.770
Eno likes pushing people around, but 
she hates being pushed around herself.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.300
Oh, shut up!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:41.670
Now, the topic of today's love lab 
is "Capturing a Boy's Interest!"

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:44.160
By the way, that gun trick is out.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.280
What?

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.680
Let's start by having Kurahashi 
teach us some techniques.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:49.430
What?!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.740
I'd like to know some, too!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.400
<i>You can do it, brain cells.</i>

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.840
<i>Think, think.</i>

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.880
Uh, um... Look up at him...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.430
Stick out your tongue...

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.810
And touch him lightly...

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.100
No!

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.960
Am I doing it wrong?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.210
<i>Now</i> you realize?!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.780
What did I do wrong?

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:49.430
Everything, I think.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.800
If I had to choose something, 
your touches were a little heavy.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:55.140
But how are we supposed 
to touch someone lightly?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.400
Right, let's see...

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:01.380
I guess beginners should start 
with touching the shoulder.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.520
<i>You're working hard.</i>

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.060
I think I could do that.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.400
Me too!

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.260
Try it, then.

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:09.400
Okay.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.370
What kind of dump is this?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.190
Ri-san, you seem down.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:18.540
Who are you calling Ri-san?

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.900
You can't even do that?

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:23.500
You can't do anything, can you?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.660
That's amazing, Yuiko-san.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.420
Could you do it to me, too?

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.510
What?

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.820
No Makio!

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.580
And Senpai, stop acting 
so nervous around Makio.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.810
He's a girl!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.430
Sh-Shut up.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.770
Even if we can do it while we're 
practicing, with a real boy...

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.730
A real boy?

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.400
I can't!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.110
You can't?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:53.660
What are you conducting 
these love labs for, then?

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.580
W-Well...

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.370
You can't help it if reality's a 
little different from your ideal.

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:02.080
But there may be someone 
out there like Huggy!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.130
Or, if I keep holding him 
like this and caring for him...

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.260
He may someday come to life!

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:15.720
What a terrifying image!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.930
Yan's just obnoxious.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.470
There are all kinds of boys.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.950
Are you sure?

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.900
There are even worse ones.

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:28.480
Ones who will lick the flutes of girls 
they like, just like someone's brother.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.490
Who?! Whose brother does that?!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.100
You're the only one I'll never tell.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.200
That's the same as telling me!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.120
Boys are so...

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.530
In that case!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:42.960
I must love him even harder 
to awaken his spirit!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.940
I'll start by sleeping with him.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.980
Gosh, I feel so excited...

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.000
You're awakening to something entirely different!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.390
No more Huggy!

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:04.020
Why don't you come to my place and 
practice with my little brother?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:04.690
What?

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.060
He's younger, and he looks like me, 
so he should be easy to talk to.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.420
Really?

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:12.570
My time has finally come!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.940
I'm finally going to a friend's house!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.740
You're way too excited for this.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.220
It's all right.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.850
I have been practicing the 
perfect simulation for this day.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.100
Yeah, you should abandon that simulation.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.000
I've got a bad feeling about it.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:26.750
What?

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.420
Just act normally.

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:29.980
That sounds fun.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.280
I'll go, too.

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.960
I'd like to go, too!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:36.060
I-I don't mind going, either!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:41.040
And it's not because I got scared 
of boys after what Maki did earlier,

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.710
so don't get the wrong idea!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.680
Real tsundere girls are such a pain.

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:50.600
Mom, my friends are coming over this Sunday.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.150
What? From Fuji Girls'?

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.030
Yeah.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.250
Are they graceful young ladies?

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:58.360
Maybe I'll stay home this Sunday.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.830
Dad, Mom.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:03.890
Don't you agree that birds 
of a feather flock together?

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.090
Rentaro-kun?

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:07.410
Wh-What?

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:10.080
Are you doing anything Sunday?

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.060
My friends and I probably—

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.780
Great, you don't. Stay home.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.880
If you're not going to listen, don't ask!

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:17.480
No way!

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.300
A bunch of girls are coming over, right?

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.940
Girls are so loud.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.980
They're persistent and jealous,

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.600
always talking about who they're 
friends with and who they like...

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.680
They're savage, too.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.730
Neat young ladies exist only in dreams.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.400
Now, now, boy. You're a little 
too young to know that.

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.680
Ren, answer the door.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.530
What?

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.420
This sucks.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:48.460
I'm sure they're all crude 
and loud like Nee-chan.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.220
Yeah, yeah. Come in.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.260
Are you Riko's younger brother?

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.960
Nice to meet you. I'm Maki Natsuo.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:58.950
Strike

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:05.720
Um...

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.620
Ren, what're you spacing out for?

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.890
Come on in.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.810
Excuse the intrusion.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.220
Come in.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.200
Rentaro-kun.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.050
My room's upstairs.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.560
Oh, okay.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.660
It's not much, but I brought this.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.690
Cake?

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:39.920
Thanks!

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.130
My room's just at the top of the stairs.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.450
You go on ahead.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.430
Okay!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.930
Mom, Maki brought cake.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.800
I-I never expected anyone like her...

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.100
Again?

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.770
Come on in.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:11:59.930
She's huge!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.310
She's tiny!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.160
Her eyebrows are so thick!

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.770
Suzu's about your height, midget.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.120
My eyebrows?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.010
Do you have a problem with my eyebrows?

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.210
I'm still in elementary school.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.800
She looks nothing like a middle schooler.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.840
What about my eyebrows?!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.680
Even elementary school kids 
don't look so childish.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.800
D-Don't cry over that!

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.560
You should be the one crying.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.300
Sorry my brother's so rude.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.940
Hey, that's it. Say something back.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.360
What? What should I say?

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:43.150
Mizushima-senpai, you seem like 
you're good at being critical.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.150
Show her how.

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.530
You're just as rude as your brother.

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:49.330
I bet you like the algae in fish tanks.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.260
Were you a snail in a past life?

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:52.450
That's too mean!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.830
In that case...

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.070
In a past life, you were a great 
snail who made people happy

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.320
by removing algae from their fish tanks.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.750
No more snails.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:04.170
Just say something you wouldn't 
want someone to say to you.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.140
Uh, um...

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:12.450
Wh-When supermarkets and convenience 
stores have marketing campaigns...

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.770
that guarantee free goods, 
I hope you get none!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.310
I feel better.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:21.750
That's great.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.780
Hey, wait!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.480
You should apologize for calling 
an older person's eyebrows thick

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:28.880
when you've never even met!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.910
What? He said that?

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.420
Sorry. I was just going with the flow.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.080
The flow?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.880
But they look good on you, 
so I don't think it's a problem.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.710
I'd tell you if they looked weird.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.780
I-In that case, you're forgiven.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.590
He's gonna be a lady killer.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.580
Is something wrong?

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.660
Ren got a little excited.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.370
Wh-Who's excited?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.350
Ren, do you want some cake?

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.320
Maki-san brought it for us.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.030
No, thanks.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.030
It's a little messy, 
but don't let it bother you.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.260
It's kind of girly.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.700
I am a girl, after all.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.790
Unpopular Girls, Read This!!

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.700
Unpopular Girls, Read This!!

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:17.710
Huh? What's this?

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:19.960
<i>I forgot to hide it!</i>

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:23.250
Is something wrong?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.920
Nothing, it's nothing!

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:29.240
I wonder what the popular Kurahashi 
is doing with a book like that.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:33.320
I-It was... a birthday gift from my brother.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.180
He doesn't know I'm popular.

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:37.560
Oh?

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:39.440
Hey, what's going on?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.950
Kurahashi has this book.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:43.160
Is something wrong?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.940
It's nothing.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.770
<b>Album</b>

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:47.780
It's a photo album.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.570
Do you want to take a look?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:51.350
It's from elementary school.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:52.410
Can I?

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.990
I'd like to see it.

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.910
Really? Let me see.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.540
Riko, you're so cute.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:03.460
Why don't you have any pictures with boys?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.210
Huh?

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.510
Oh? Now that you mention it...

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:09.470
If you were popular, you should 
have tons of pictures with boys.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.390
There really aren't any.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.480
Well, that's because...

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.870
<i>Are you finally going to tell them?</i>

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.220
The truth is...

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.230
Your boyfriends weren't allowed 
to have their photos taken?

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.230
Huh?

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:25.150
They were international spies who 
had to keep their identities hidden,

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.400
or VIPs whose lives were in danger.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.680
If they were old-fashioned,

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.230
they'd be afraid their souls
 would be taken with the photo.

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:32.510
Are you stupid?

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.360
There's no way that's true.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.080
If they can't take photos, it's because 
they're employed by a talent agency.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.540
You've dated so many different kinds of people.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.000
Th-That's true, actually.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.530
Amazing!

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.840
<i>Is this what you want, Kurahashi?</i>

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.800
<i>Calm down, calm down.</i>

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:56.140
Ren, go buy some juice 
from the convenience store.

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.010
Why me?

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:02.400
Riko bought that juice for her guests.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:04.520
I'm going, then.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.320
While you're out, buy some snacks, too.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.060
That will be 514 yen.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:19.160
Campaign!!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:16.970
Okay.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:25.450
<b>Win fabulous prizes! 
</b>Campaign

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:25.450
<b></b>Spend 500 yen and you're
 guaranteed<b> a lottery ticket!</b>

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:25.450
Welcome

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:25.450
Total

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.570
Out of 600 yen.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.610
Your change is 86 yen.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.500
Thank you.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.350
Welcome.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.060
We're currently offering lottery tickets
 to customers who spend over 500 yen.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.260
Go right ahead.

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.770
<i>I didn't get one.</i>

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.690
Sorry about that.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:54.110
I didn't think Ren would 
act like that towards girls.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.900
It's fine.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:58.740
That was the first time I've been 
able to talk back to someone.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.240
I can never find the words...

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:05.230
I'm impressed you two can talk back 
to boys without breaking a sweat.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.780
It's not that impressive.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:07.600
I know.

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:11.000
I'll teach you some simple and extremely 
damaging verbal abuse you can use.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.130
No! Don't taint Suzu!

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:16.490
I wasn't able to talk back very well, either.

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.800
<b>Maki's Imagination</b>

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.800
<i>What are you, stupid?</i>

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.240
The next time I see him, 
I'll really give it to him!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.640
It takes one to know one!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:27.630
If we were eel lunches, I'd be 
regular and you'd be extra special!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.560
You admit you're both stupid, then?

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.750
If we were curry, I'd be regular,

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:35.600
and Japan's biggest eater 
would try to take you on!

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.280
Yeah, you're stupid, all right.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:44.440
<b>Meanwhile, Ren</b>

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.050
<i>I wonder what she's talking about now.</i>

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:44.450
<i>I bet it's something intellectual.</i>

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.840
I'm home!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.670
Thanks for helping.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.000
It's no trouble.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.680
<i>Someone's in the kitchen.</i>

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.170
<i>Could it be?</i>

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.720
Mom, I'm back from shopping.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.080
Damn, it's just the midget.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.310
Ow!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.530
By the way, I missed my chance.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.030
<i>Missed chance</i>, not pissed pants!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.200
I didn't get the guaranteed lottery 
ticket for spending 500 yen!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.280
Did you curse me, midget?

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.950
<i>So mean!</i>

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.370
<i>I need to say something quickly.</i>

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.790
<i>Quickly, quickly...</i>

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:36.380
<i>Is he waiting for me to say something?</i>

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.440
What? You don't have anything to say?

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.970
Um, uh...

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.770
<i>I'll use the one Mizushima-senpai just taught me...</i>

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:48.060
Serves you right!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.850
You'll be bald in 21 years!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.190
What's with the weirdly prophetic abuse?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.660
You stupid midget!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:57.440
Ow!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.950
<i>I thought he was mean, unlike Riko-senpai,</i>

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.370
<i>but he might actually be a little nice.</i>

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.470
Why do I have to do all of this?

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:10.040
Don't whine.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.340
I'll take that upstairs.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.210
Oh, um... Here.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.300
Thank you.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.270
What's with the dreamy expression, boy?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.810
Nee-chan's friend is really pretty!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.720
Really?

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:32.600
Yeah!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.780
She's beautiful, slim, and a proper lady.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:39.170
Nee-chan totally pales in comparison. I pity her.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:42.490
I think I'll be pitying <i>you</i> in a second.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.490
Damn it, that Ren.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.000
I can be...

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.160
Hello, I'm Kurahashi Riko!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.280
Mom, come check this out.

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.650
We've got a nice young lady in the family.

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:01.590
Ren!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.010
Rentaro-kun!

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.490
Do you want me to keep my mouth shut?

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.220
My allowance is pretty meager.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.590
You can have mine.

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:12.330
I want your ice cream.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.350
Take it.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.620
Also, ask Maki-san if she likes younger boys.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.190
You know, in general.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.740
Maybe I'll tell Maki my brother is mean.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:26.450
Th-That's not fair!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.950
But if you gave me your ice 
cream, I'd tell her you're nice.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.500
You can have it!

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.420
Thank you for having us.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.910
Later.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:38.090
Come back any time.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.790
Ren-kun.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.380
I was just talking to Maki, and...

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.720
Maki-san?

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.470
Elementary schoolers are 
so mischievous and cute.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.730
It makes me feel like a mother.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.590
That's what she told me.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:58.110
Too bad.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.280
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.080
I'm home.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.700
The test I was hiding...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.540
You're going to cram school 
starting next week!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.610
<b>Tattled</b>

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.620
<i>Serves you right.</i>

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.640
Hey.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:23.270
Hey, Sacchan.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.510
Who are you calling Sacchan?!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.260
That's what we used to call you.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.340
Because you were cute.

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.300
I told you to stop calling 
me that back then, too!

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:32.680
Kurahashi?

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:37.030
Yan, I heard you tricked 
Maki by calling her cute.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:38.030
What?

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:39.810
Maki was upset.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.900
She said you're extra special challenge curry.

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:44.200
What?

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.640
I did call her cute, but it was...

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:47.900
You really said that?!

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.120
I'm telling you, that was...

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:52.030
For you to compliment her, she must be a fox!

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:53.820
I really want to see her.

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:54.910
Listen to me.

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:56.660
<i>What's his problem?</i>

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>He used to like me...</i>

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:02.300
You know, Maki was with me the other day.

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:03.120
Huh?

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:06.420
Oh...

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.340
I could only see you then.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.340
N-No, that's not what I meant!

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:16.060
Don't get the wrong idea, you idiot!

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:17.590
What did you say?

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:19.770
Well, it takes one to know one!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:23.980
<i>What's wrong with them?</i>

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:03.360
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:58.420 --> 00:24:01.180
<i>When it comes to cutting people deeply,</i>

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:03.830
<i>no one is better than Mizushima-senpai.</i>

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:06.250
<i>Ren-kun was tearing up at the end.</i>

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:07.400
<i>You're exaggerating.</i>

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.710
<i>Oh, Eno, you've got shredded 
seaweed on your head.</i>

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:10.380
<i>Is something wrong?</i>

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:13.320
<i>She cut me! She cut so deep...</i>

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:14.220
<i>Oh, come on.</i>

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:17.720
<i>As long as you've got a strong spirit, 
you can endure most anything.</i>

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:20.560
<i>Kurahashi the heartbreaker, 
you're so wonderful.</i>

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:23.300
<i>I bet you have boys confessing 
their feelings to you every day.</i>

00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:27.140
<b>To the Wild Kid...</b>

00:24:23.300 --> 00:24:26.400
<i>Why are you crying even though 
she complimented you, Riko?</i>

00:24:27.170 --> 00:24:30.100
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
